{"ticker":"NIO","updated":"2026-10-30T23:01:22Z","profile":{"longName":"NIO Inc.","shortName":"NIO Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","country":"China","website":"https://www.nio.com","fullTimeEmployees":35032,"marketCap":8043191296,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":25.776796,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.07048405,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":6.101536,"targetHighPrice":10.181563,"targetLowPrice":3.7106397,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.691,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.1736,"operatingMargins":-0.0108,"profitMargins":-0.04168,"totalRevenue":114113634304,"beta":0.924,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":7.54,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":3.16,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"NIO Inc. designs, develops, manufactures, and sells smart electric vehicles in China, Europe, and internationally. It offers five and six-seater electric SUVs, as well as smart electric sedans. The company also offers power solutions, including Power Home, a home charging solution; Power Swap, a battery-swapping service; Power Charger and Destination Charger; Power Mobile, a mobile charging service through charging vans; Power Map, an application that provides access to a network of public chargers and their real-time information; and One Click for power valet service. In addition, it provides repair, maintenance, car beauty, and inspection services through its service centers and authorized third-party service centers; vehicle transportation and delivery, pre-delivery inspections, guidance on vehicle features, assistance with vehicle registration, and insurance processing services; insurance, maintenance, repairs, accident rescue, car washing, chauffeur services, and valet parking services; and remote monitoring and real-time diagnostics services, as well as technical, warranty, and auto financing arrangements. Further, the company is involved in the provision of energy and service packages to its users; design and technology development activities; manufacture of electric powertrains, battery packs, and components; and sales and after-sales management activities. Additionally","summary_zh":"蔚來公司在中國、歐洲和國際上設計、開發、製造和銷售智慧電動車。它提供五人座和六人座電動SUV，以及智慧電動轎車。該公司還提供電源解決方案，包括家庭充電解決方案Power Home； Power Swap，電池更換服務；電源充電器和目的地充電器； Power Mobile，透過充電器提供行動充電服務； Power Map，一款可存取公共充電器網路及其即時資訊的應用程式；以及一鍵代客泊車服務。此外，還透過其服務中心及授權的第三方服務中心提供維修、保養、汽車美容、檢測服務；車輛運輸交付、交車前檢驗、車輛特性指導、車輛登記協助、保險辦理服務；保險、保養、維修、事故救援、洗車、代駕服務、代客泊車服務；遠端監控和即時診斷服務，以及技術、保固和汽車融資安排。此外，該公司還向用戶提供能源和服務包；設計和技術開發活動；電動動力總成、電池組和零件的製造；以及銷售和售後管理活動。另外","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車製造商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":6.24,"h":6.64,"l":6.06,"c":6.58,"v":123577100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":6.38,"h":6.4,"l":6.04,"c":6.32,"v":89712400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":6.07,"h":6.19,"l":5.97,"c":6.13,"v":72831200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":6.18,"h":6.23,"l":5.92,"c":5.95,"v":59299500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":6.05,"h":6.23,"l":5.95,"c":6.17,"v":81801400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":6.06,"h":6.32,"l":6.05,"c":6.28,"v":54499200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":5.74,"h":5.78,"l":5.6,"c":5.72,"v":237836500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":5.83,"h":6.13,"l":5.77,"c":6.07,"v":95275100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":6.03,"h":6.29,"l":5.94,"c":6.22,"v":75071300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":6.46,"h":6.83,"l":6.42,"c":6.49,"v":68234900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":6.55,"h":7.09,"l":6.48,"c":7.02,"v":130662500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":7.23,"h":7.45,"l":7.06,"c":7.45,"v":122761800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":7.23,"h":7.5,"l":7.2,"c":7.37,"v":76975000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":7.59,"h":7.6,"l":7.28,"c":7.37,"v":79099400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":7.37,"h":7.41,"l":6.8,"c":6.91,"v":128795300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":6.9,"h":7.17,"l":6.77,"c":6.93,"v":80663300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":7.08,"h":7.34,"l":6.98,"c":7.12,"v":76711800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":7.05,"h":7.68,"l":7.0,"c":7.47,"v":92782900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":7.31,"h":7.37,"l":6.96,"c":7.04,"v":92524000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":7.13,"h":7.27,"l":6.92,"c":7.21,"v":653